{"c":[{"name":"20260924T004708Z-e3de1689c901c73d","text":"BenchLM slugs use dashes (gpt-5-6-sol); Cursor stems use dots (gpt-5.6-sol), cursor- prefixes, and -thinking. Direct scores[model_key(slug)] hits 2 of 12 live Task slugs; dots-to-dashes hits 9. BenchLM also has real -thinking slugs (claude-opus-4-5-thinking).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260924T133144Z-b367cb7052eb77f8","text":"choose-verification-model tiers are the operator's trust calibration, not a function of score (kimi-k3 A above opus S is intended). Never derive a tier from score neighbors. New models are onboarded with a hand tier the hour they ship; outside-author placement is not needed.","type":"note"}]}
